{"ambiguities":[],"artifact_kind":"draft","category_review":{"ambiguities":"None; the normative profiles specify representation and ordering.","entities":"D1 declares canonical typed solve, JSON input/result and normative semantics.","error_semantics":"Malformed-input behavior is excluded.","explicit_non_goals":"N1 excludes malformed-input behavior; N2 excludes runtime campaigns and downstream assurance.","invariants":"Input preservation is required in every source-policy guarantee; no separate algorithmic invariant is stated.","liveness_properties":"Typed totality is required; no separate timing requirement is stated.","postconditions":"O1 and O2 preserve universal exact signed floor-sum behavior and all mandatory source facets.","preconditions":"A1 is the sole explicit input-supplier assumption; no extra bounds apply.","resource_constraints":"No complexity bound or physical-resource assurance is requested.","safety_properties":"S1 and S2 are required source-only operational guarantees retaining all seven source properties."},"entities":[{"acceptance_criteria":["The canonical file has exactly one admitted typed entry named solve with arity 1.","Input and result types represent the specified JSON object and integer result under data-pipeline/0.3.","Source semantics follow normative Lean vscore-semantics/0.3, including unbounded integers and Unicode scalar string semantics."],"dependencies":[],"id":"D1","kind":"entity","lifecycle":{"END_TO_END_VERIFIED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"declarations carry no end-to-end correctness claim","scope":[]},"FORMALIZED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"IMPLEMENTED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"INTERPRETED":{"evidence_refs":["provenance:tier2:tier2-source-facets-006:A23"],"outcome":"PASS","reason":"Recorded interpretation proposal; not ma